# Suppressions for woody-woodpacker work.
# Keep this file EMPTY of real suppressions unless you have a proven reason —
# a leak or an invalid-access you suppressed is one you still have at
# defense, and "must never crash" is a hard subject requirement here.
#
# Template, in case you ever need one:
#
# {
#    name_of_suppression
#    Memcheck:Leak
#    fun:malloc
#    fun:some_library_function
# }
